{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は本当にあみにとって最高に幸せすぎる日だったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝日新聞の取材で愛未と万理華とせいらりんが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージカル界では知らない人はいないと言われている舞台女優、笹本玲奈さんにインタビューをさせていただいたんだけども..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は能條が3才の時、始めて観に行ったミュージカル「ピーターパン」のピーターパン役を演じていたのが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当時13歳だった笹本玲奈さんだったんです。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはそれは鮮明に覚えてます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして愛未がその時に言った言葉、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あみもあっちに立ちたい。あーいうふうになりたい。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この一言からあみの芸能界へ目指す日々は始まったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからもずっとミュージカルも笹本さんが出てる舞台はたくさん観に行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな笹本さんと能條が今日お仕事としてご一緒させていただいたのです...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動以外のなにものでもありません（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶっちゃけインタビュー中も涙がこみあげてきそうになった（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神様ありがとう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもね？2....2ショットまでとっていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー❤❤❤嬉しい❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーしーて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は久しぶりに私服でものっけてみよっかな？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーらよっと！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青のニット帽は最近買った❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりあみ青が好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブルー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BIGBANGのなかでもBLUEって曲が好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへ。\n最近毎日お稽古で演技が出来て幸せ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返すーおん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコレートは\nミルク派？ホワイト派？ビター派？\n答えてくれると嬉しいです(*^▽^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはやっぱりホワイト派かなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビターも嫌いじゃないよ？？ビター。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみは男性にどんな服を着てもらいたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ザ 爽やか！！って感じも好きだし、\nKーpopっぽい派手な服装も好きっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみが毎日欠かさないことは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日が終わる時、今日も幸せでした。って心の中で言ってから寝るの(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみの男装とか見たいんだけどやらないのかな？\nいつか機会があったら見たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっ！！それは是非是非やりたいなあ♪(´ε｀ )\n本格的な男装やってみたいんだよねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/19/4467839/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合うかなー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條さんはバンドは聴きますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーバンドはあまり聞かないかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみがつけてるミニーちゃんのカチューシャ\n私も買っていいかなあ？\nそしたらおそろっち！いえあ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえあ！！おそろっちにしようぜーっ (๑╹∀╹๑)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみはジェットコースターとか余裕で乗れちゃう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余裕余裕！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言うのはちょっぴり盛ってて...やっぱり乗る瞬間は怖いなって思うよ！でも乗っちゃえば、フィィィィーーーー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の握手会、\n青いジャケット着てって\nあみあみにおしゃれーって言ってもらったけど、\nおぼえてるかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋でだよね！？覚えてるよー！！またあみのとこ来てね？❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日京都で握手会待ってるよ↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷"}],"source":"archive"}